<p>Given how scenic the Serra de Tramuntana crossing is, some travellers with a later flight and no fixed itinerary prefer to build in extra time for a stop along the way, whether at a viewpoint over the mountains or in one of the villages the road passes near. Because a private transfer isn't bound to a shared shuttle's fixed route, this kind of detour can be arranged in advance, giving you a last look at the Tramuntana before joining the flatter roads into Palma. Travellers who want more flexibility for sightseeing on the way to the airport may find our <a href="/hourly-chauffeur/">hourly chauffeur</a> service better suited to a leisurely final morning on the island.</p>
